  biomeName: The Shattered Cliff-Base
  minDepthMeters: 1500
  maxDepthMeters: 2000
  shortDescription: A debris valley of square megablocks fallen from above.
  isPlaceholder: 0
  visitPurpose: Transition biome. Come here to push deeper, find better materials,
    and read walls, fissures, and major vertical routes.
  commonRewardHook: Reliable value comes from Iron Composite and Copper Ore.
  rareRewardHook: 'The rare pull is real: Titanium Scrap and Structural Bracket.'
  landmarkIdentity: The Shattered Cliff-Base reads through walls, fins, fissures,
    and giant vertical breaks. Landmarks should feel large and route-defining.
  safePocketIdentity: Safe pockets live behind slab cover and under wall breaks.
  riskSummary: 'Main failure mode: vertical trap geometry and hard commitment, then
    overstaying for loot. Creature pressure stays medium.'
  extractionFocus: 'Pocket mining along walls and ledges with careful positioning.
    Mid-depth: work edges, cracks, and vertical seams, then return before greed stretches
    the route.'
  landmarkGuidance: Dominant landmark is wall face or cliff step. This slot should
    read through tall wall ribs and shadowed benches; use walls and breaks to mark
    route commitment.
